      "item_body": "<p>Determine the value of the second derivative at the indicated value. State whether the curve lies above or below the tangent line at that point.</p>\n<p>a. f(x) = 2x^3 - 10x + 3, at x = 2: second derivative <span id=\"blank_a8008824-aada-4b2c-9588-1e5a4e4cf30f\"></span>; the curve lies <span id=\"blank_2a65c7fb-5d58-4678-a565-3fc4af1b947f\"></span> the tangent line.</p>\n<p>b. g(x) = x^2 - 1/x, at x = -1: second derivative <span id=\"blank_785508c6-9f5b-4700-b2dc-2c5c6f92e08a\"></span>; the curve lies <span id=\"blank_a760d030-e930-4d5d-91a4-2ff980382f73\"></span> the tangent line.</p>\n<p>c. p(w) = w/sqrt(w^2 + 1), at w = 3: second derivative <span id=\"blank_993f7fd1-eaf4-4b84-a036-761bd2e2ae85\"></span>; the curve lies <span id=\"blank_3c882dec-a305-4b87-b8e2-2cb0f4d745da\"></span> the tangent line.</p>\n<p>d. s(t) = 2t/(t - 4), at t = -2: second derivative <span id=\"blank_f4a0e4b9-08de-404d-a5b9-d9b06e7dea45\"></span>; the curve lies <span id=\"blank_66f80ce2-7528-4b79-9dcd-921249087e19\"></span> the tangent line.</p>",
